# Poker Game Server | C++ Poker Game Server

## Overview

A real-time multiplayer poker game requires a reliable game server to manage
players, rooms, game states and settlements.

The TexasHoldem-Poker-Complete-Solution project uses C++ as an important part
of the game server architecture.

## Server Responsibilities

The poker game server can be responsible for:

- Player connections
- Room management
- Game lifecycle
- Player actions
- Betting state
- Pot calculation
- Game settlement
- Room synchronization
- Reconnection
- Player status

